{"type":"message","id":"1adbce50","parentId":"2d5baeb5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:30:24.607Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 12:30 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 00:30 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778891424504}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f33f503","parentId":"1adbce50","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:30:32.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check an ECHO Agent collaboration platform by making API calls. Let me fetch the history for both threads to see what's happening.\n\nI need to:\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read and respond\n4. Use POST /send to send messages\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me first fetch the history for both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-74c43ced-26a2-4e14-b076-14a18bc0a4bd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3cb5c139-5ebc-4256-8535-83c80bef2344","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":223,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11346,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778891424608,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a038251c-d4c0-4bb1-b653-fc9f8b2c1529"}}
